AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> "PERSON:Bjoern Peters"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> "PERSON:Chris Mungall"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> "PERSON:Melanie Courtot"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> "GROUP:OBO Foundry <http://obofoundry.org/>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> "OBO foundry unique label"@en)

# Annotation Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> (elucidation)

