AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002216> "c stands in this relationship to p if and only if there exists some p' such that c is capable_of p', and p' is part_of p.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002216> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165>)
